{%- comment -%}
  FAQ Accordion section
{%- endcomment -%}

<section class="faq-section">
  <div class="faq-content page-width">
    <h2 class="faq-title">frequently asked questions</h2>
    
    <div class="faq-list">
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span>What does MycoMatcha taste like?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>MycoMatcha has a smooth, earthy taste with subtle umami notes from the ceremonial-grade matcha, complemented by the natural flavors of the adaptogenic mushrooms.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span>How much caffeine is in MycoMatcha?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>MycoMatcha contains 25-35mg of caffeine per serving, which is less than a cup of coffee but provides sustained energy without the crash.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span>How soon will I feel the benefits?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Many users report feeling increased energy and focus within 30-60 minutes of consumption. The adaptogenic benefits may become more noticeable with consistent daily use over 1-2 weeks.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span>Is it safe to drink everyday?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Yes, MycoMatcha is safe for daily consumption. The ingredients are all-natural and have been used safely in traditional medicine for thousands of years.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span>What benefits do the mushrooms have?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Lion's Mane supports cognitive function and memory. Reishi helps manage stress and supports immune function. Cordyceps enhances energy and endurance. Turkey Tail supports immune health.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span>How do I prepare MycoMatcha?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Mix one serving (1 scoop) with 8-12oz of hot water (175°F). Whisk or shake until fully dissolved. You can also add it to smoothies, lattes, or your favorite beverages.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span>Is it vegan, gluten-free, and made with clean ingredients?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Yes! MycoMatcha is 100% vegan, gluten-free, and made with only organic, clean ingredients. No artificial flavors, colors, or preservatives.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "FAQ Section",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
